    "note": "Introduced version (HTML copy). Sec. 3 (RCW 9.41.300) strikes subsections (2)-(4) of existing law (local limits on discharge restrictions, stadium/convention-center possession, firearm-business zoning, same-penalty rule) and renumbers; the rest of the reprinted section is unchanged existing law. Sec. 1 is legislative findings, not quoted."
